{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.596, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:25.067Z", "t_ms": 6543, "delta": "MetaGPT"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.733, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:25.205Z", "t_ms": 6680, "delta": " assigns and manages roles for its agents through the following mechanisms:\n\n* **Assembly Line"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.953, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:25.426Z", "t_ms": 6901, "delta": " Paradigm and Human SOPs**: MetaGPT adopts an assembly line paradigm modeled after human software development Standardized Operating Procedures (SOP"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.089, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:25.561Z", "t_ms": 7036, "delta": "s) [C1, C2]. This decomposes complex software engineering tasks into a structured, sequential workflow carried out by specialized"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.318, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:25.790Z", "t_ms": 7265, "delta": " roles: Product Manager, Architect, Project Manager, Engineer, and QA Engineer [C1, C2].\n*"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.474, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:25.947Z", "t_ms": 7422, "delta": " **Role Profiles and Constraints**: For each role, MetaGPT specifies a dedicated profile that explicitly defines the agent's name"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.694, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:26.165Z", "t_ms": 7641, "delta": ", profile, goal, and constraints [C2].\n* **Specialized Context and Tooling**: Each role is initialized with domain"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.851, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:26.322Z", "t_ms": 7797, "delta": "-specific skills, tools, and operational contexts [C2]. For example, a Product Manager is equipped with web search tools"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.005, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:26.477Z", "t_ms": 7952, "delta": ", whereas an Engineer is configured to execute code [C2].\n* **Structured Outputs and Communication Schemas**: Rather"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.198, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:26.671Z", "t_ms": 8146, "delta": " than engaging in unconstrained natural language dialogue, each role is assigned a specific output format and schema [C3]. For instance,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.416, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:26.887Z", "t_ms": 8362, "delta": " the Product Manager outputs a Product Requirement Document (PRD), the Architect produces system interfaces and sequence diagrams, the Project Manager distributes"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.604, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:27.076Z", "t_ms": 8551, "delta": " tasks, and the QA Engineer writes test cases [C2, C3].\n* **Profile-Based Subscription Mechanism**: Agents operate"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.878, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:27.350Z", "t_ms": 8826, "delta": " within a shared message pool using a publish-subscribe model [C3]. Each role subscribes to messages and deliverables based on its profile-"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.168, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:27.639Z", "t_ms": 9115, "delta": "specific interests and dependency requirements (e.g., the Architect monitors and reacts to the Product Manager's PRD),"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.281, "data": {"request_id": "b1a06f32ca03", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:08:27.754Z", "t_ms": 9229, "delta": " activating actions only after receiving all required prerequisites [C2, C4]."}}
